⚠️ Rules should be the same as for create endpoint ⚠️:

* unique type → only one rule with given type is OK
* global and split spending allowance rules can not exist at the same time → {{spending-allowance}} with {{transportation-spending-allowance}} or {{food-spending-allowance}} is NOT valid, same with {{group-*}}
* split spending allowance rules must be either all enabled or all disabled → {{transportation-spending-allowance}} ({{enabled}}: true) & {{food-spending-allowance}} ({{enabled}}: false) is NOT valid, same with {{group-*}}
* rule should include {{period}} and {{enabled}} and {{limit}} (if {{enabled}}: true); {{currency}} is optional

