*Pulled report on the 25th of August (AVG Days in Stage vs July):*

* *Application Review*: 16.94 vs 13.41 → *+*{color:#ff5630}*26.32%*{color}
* *Recruiter Screen*: 12.18 vs 12.08 → *+*{color:#97a0af}*0.83%*{color}
* *Hackerrank*: 9.36 vs 7.41 → *+*{color:#ff5630}*26.32%*{color}
